            <note corresp="#d314-f2" n="3" xml:id="d314-f2-content">
                <p>Approved by Rusk on May 15. In a September
                    8 memorandum to Jessup, Trueheart noted that “the study is just now getting
                    under way.” (Department of State, INR/IL
                    Historical Files, 303 Committee Records)</p>
            </note>
